Scoped maskedthreshold video filter

The option table, the eight-bit pix_fmts subset, threshold8_abs and
threshold8_diff, the plane mask with its reference-plane copy, the size check
of config_output, the framesync input configuration and the output properties
of process_frame in src/video-ops/maskedthreshold.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_maskedthreshold.c (maskedthreshold_options, pix_fmts,
threshold8_abs, threshold8_diff, config_input, threshold_slice, process_frame,
config_output).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
